# Environment variables
#
# This file is intentionally empty in the template.
#
# A derived repository must not imply that a database, API key, runtime,
# port, or other environment variable exists before the real project defines it.
# During project intake, document only variables the project actually requires,
# using placeholders or descriptions rather than real values.
#
# Local environment files such as .env remain protected by .gitignore.
